# Dragon Magazine Compendium - alternative class features for classes of Player's Handbook II (loaded only with it; acf_build.py).

Dead Levels	KEY:Beguiler ACF ~ Dead Levels (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.BeguilerACF.BeguilerDeadLevels	PRECLASS:1,Beguiler=4	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Beguiler Dead Levels (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.137	DESC:Alternative class feature (beguiler, 4th level). Minor abilities for the beguiler's dead levels (it gains spells per day at every level; replaces nothing): Clever Wording (Ex), 4th level - delivering a secret message with Bluff, false information is implied only on a failure by 6 or more (5 or more: the message is not conveyed); this margin rises by 1 at 9th, 13th, 16th and 18th level (10 or more at 18th). Lively Discourse (Ex), 12th level - intricate messages naming locations, people and times at Bluff DC 30. Piqued Hearing (Ex), 17th level - within 30 feet of a conversation containing a secret message he notices it effortlessly (Sense Motive).
Dead Levels	KEY:ACF ~ Beguiler Dead Levels (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Beguiler Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.137	DESC:Minor abilities for the beguiler's dead levels (it gains spells per day at every level; replaces nothing): Clever Wording (Ex), 4th level - delivering a secret message with Bluff, false information is implied only on a failure by 6 or more (5 or more: the message is not conveyed); this margin rises by 1 at 9th, 13th, 16th and 18th level (10 or more at 18th). Lively Discourse (Ex), 12th level - intricate messages naming locations, people and times at Bluff DC 30. Piqued Hearing (Ex), 17th level - within 30 feet of a conversation containing a secret message he notices it effortlessly (Sense Motive).
Shamanic Invocation	KEY:Dragon Shaman ACF ~ Shamanic Invocation (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.Dragon ShamanACF.DragonShamanAura5	PRECLASS:1,Dragon Shaman=5	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Shamanic Invocation (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.200	DESC:Alternative class feature (dragon shaman, 5th level). A stronger spiritual link to the totem: you learn one least draconic invocation of the dragonfire adept (Dragon Magic), following the dragonfire adept's rules but ignoring arcane spell failure, at caster level %1 (dragon shaman level - 4; choose it by hand). Replaces the new draconic aura at 5th level: you never know more than six draconic auras (applied).
Shamanic Invocation	KEY:ACF ~ Shamanic Invocation (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Dragon Shaman Class Feature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|DraconicAuras|-1|PREVARGTEQ:DragonShamanLVL,5	SOURCEPAGE:p.200	DESC:A stronger spiritual link to the totem: you learn one least draconic invocation of the dragonfire adept (Dragon Magic), following the dragonfire adept's rules but ignoring arcane spell failure, at caster level %1 (dragon shaman level - 4; choose it by hand). Replaces the new draconic aura at 5th level: you never know more than six draconic auras (applied).|max(1,DragonShamanLVL-4)
Dead Levels	KEY:Duskblade ACF ~ Dead Levels (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.DuskbladeACF.DuskbladeDeadLevels	PRECLASS:1,Duskblade=8	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Duskblade Dead Levels (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.256	DESC:Alternative class feature (duskblade, 8th level). Elven Insight (Ex), 8th level: the duskblade uses her Intelligence modifier instead of Charisma for Diplomacy and Gather Information checks with elves or in elven communities, with a +%1 bonus on them (+1 at 9th, +1 more at 12th, 14th, 17th and 19th). Replaces nothing.
Dead Levels	KEY:ACF ~ Duskblade Dead Levels (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Duskblade Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.256	DESC:Elven Insight (Ex), 8th level: the duskblade uses her Intelligence modifier instead of Charisma for Diplomacy and Gather Information checks with elves or in elven communities, with a +%1 bonus on them (+1 at 9th, +1 more at 12th, 14th, 17th and 19th). Replaces nothing.|(var("CL=Duskblade")>=9)+(var("CL=Duskblade")>=12)+(var("CL=Duskblade")>=14)+(var("CL=Duskblade")>=17)+(var("CL=Duskblade")>=19)
Dead Levels	KEY:Knight ACF ~ Dead Levels (DMC)	CATEGORY:ACF	COST:0	TYPE:ACF.KnightACF.KnightDeadLevels	PRECLASS:1,Knight=18	ABILITY:Special Ability|AUTOMATIC|ACF ~ Knight Dead Levels (DMC)	SOURCEPAGE:p.329	DESC:Alternative class feature (knight, 18th level). Gallant Nature (Ex), 18th level (the knight's single dead level): once per day he can reroll a Diplomacy check made to influence the attitude of nobility or royalty, taking the reroll. Replaces nothing.
Dead Levels	KEY:ACF ~ Knight Dead Levels (DMC)	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:SpecialQuality.Knight Class Feature	SOURCEPAGE:p.329	DESC:Gallant Nature (Ex), 18th level (the knight's single dead level): once per day he can reroll a Diplomacy check made to influence the attitude of nobility or royalty, taking the reroll. Replaces nothing.
